Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Roles|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Organization Role
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And RoleNavigator goto Role Type
		|roleType|Organization|
	And Role add
		|roleTitle|Roles Orgrole Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	Then Role view CP
		|roleTitle|Roles Orgrole Name|
		|roleType|Organization|
Scenario: Add Regular Role
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	When Role add
		|roleTitle|Roles Regrole Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	Then Role view CP
		|roleTitle|Roles Regrole Name|
		|roleType|Regular|
Scenario: Add Site Role
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And RoleNavigator goto Role Type
		|roleType|Site|
	And Role add
		|roleTitle|Roles Siterole Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	Then Role view CP
		|roleTitle|Roles Siterole Name|
		|roleType|Site|
Scenario: Delete Regular Role
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role add
		|roleTitle|Roles Regrole Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role delete CP
		|roleTitle|Roles Regrole Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	Then Role view Default CP
		|roleTitle|Roles Regrole Name|